<?xml version="1.0"?><iai friendlyname="Kids - How a spider build a web" id="00170804" height="411" width="570" hasaudio="0" hascredits="0" lang="E" basecontroltype="SlideShowControl" outlinecolorid="1" skinstyle="kidsGray" skinlib="kids1"><slides><slide type="standard" slideid="2" sequence="1"><standardslide locklabelson="1" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;La araña inicia su red con un hilo de seda que recibe el nombre de cabo puente. Toda la red quedará suspendida de este hilo.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;La araña empieza a construir la red&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><image>00170804_1.swf</image><audiofile/><labels><label labelid="0" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="186" y="140"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><side>left</side><points><point><x>-6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>-44</x><y>-38</y></point></points><origin><x>181</x><y>150</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Cabo puente&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget/><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Cabo puente&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/></label></labels><keywords/><imagerefid/><audiorefid/><imageheight>380</imageheight><imagewidth>414</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;La araña empieza a construir la red&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide><slide type="standard" slideid="1" sequence="2"><standardslide locklabelson="1" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;La araña va añadiendo más hilos a la red. Va construyendo todos los radios que van a formar la tela de araña.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;La araña añade más hilos a la red&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><image>00170804_2.swf</image><audiofile/><labels/><keywords/><imagerefid/><audiorefid/><imageheight>380</imageheight><imagewidth>414</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;La araña añade más hilos a la red&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide><slide type="standard" slideid="3" sequence="3"><standardslide locklabelson="1" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;A continuación, la araña construye una espiral de seda pegajosa. La tela queda finalizada en menos de una hora.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;Seda pegajosa&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><image>00170804_3.swf</image><audiofile/><labels/><keywords/><imagerefid/><audiorefid/><imageheight>380</imageheight><imagewidth>414</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;Seda pegajosa&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide><slide type="standard" slideid="4" sequence="4"><standardslide locklabelson="1" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;La araña añade un hilo de aviso hasta el centro de la tela y espera hasta que caiga una presa. Cuando un insecto cae en la tela, el hilo de aviso vibra. La araña ya tiene lista su comida.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;La captura de la presa&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><image>00170804_4.swf</image><audiofile/><labels><label labelid="0" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="138" y="292"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><side>right</side><points><point><x>6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>41</x><y>-35</y></point></points><origin><x>229</x><y>302</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Hilo de aviso&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget/><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Hilo de aviso&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/></label><label labelid="1" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="204" y="121"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><side>left</side><points><point><x>-6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>-28</x><y>22</y></point></points><origin><x>199</x><y>139</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Insecto atrapado en la tela&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget/><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Insecto atrapado&lt;br&gt;en la tela&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/></label></labels><keywords/><imagerefid/><audiorefid/><imageheight>380</imageheight><imagewidth>414</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;La captura de la presa&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide><slide type="standard" slideid="5" sequence="5"><standardslide locklabelson="1" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;La araña muerde a su presa y le inyecta un veneno. Después, envuelve a su presa en un capullo de seda y la devora absorbiendo sus jugos.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;Lista para comer&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><image>00170804_5.swf</image><audiofile/><labels/><keywords/><imagerefid/><audiorefid/><imageheight>380</imageheight><imagewidth>414</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;Lista para comer&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide></slides><slideshowcontrol bottombarbgcolorid="4" textdividerbarcolorid="4" creditsbuttonstyleid="2" resetbuttonstyleid="3" navbuttonstyleid="1" numbermenuitems="0" showpop="1" autoadvance="0" shownavarrows="1" bottombarheight="31"><audiocontrollerstyle bgcolorid="5" progresscolorid="4" guttercolorid="5" graphiccolorid="3" outlinecolorid="6" buttonstyleid="1"/><popmenustyle listtextstyleid="3" displaytextstyleid="3" selectedlisttextstyleid="3" rolllisttextstyleid="3" downlisttextstyleid="3" rolloutlinecolorid="7" displaybgcolorid="3" listbgcolorid="3" listoutlinecolorid="7" displayoutlinecolorid="7" popbuttonstyleid="1"><scrollbarstyle guttercolorid="7" thumbbasecolorid="8" thumbrollcolorid="9" thumbdowncolorid="9" buttonstyleid="1"/></popmenustyle><captionscrollbarstyle guttercolorid="7" thumbbasecolorid="8" thumbrollcolorid="9" thumbdowncolorid="9" buttonstyleid="1"/><creditsbuttontext>Credits</creditsbuttontext><resetbuttontext>&lt;html&gt;Reset&lt;/html&gt;</resetbuttontext><currentslidetext textstyleid="4"><text>&lt;html&gt;% de #&lt;/html&gt;</text></currentslidetext></slideshowcontrol><textstyles><textstyle size="15" font="Trebuchet MS" bold="1" italic="1" underline="0" colorid="10" align="left" id="1"/><textstyle size="13" font="Trebuchet MS" bold="0" italic="0" underline="0" colorid="10" align="left" id="2"/><textstyle si